Assess the current economic climate based on trending news headlines. Focus on indicators like inflation, interest rates, and unemployment. If the prevailing sentiment paints a picture of robust growth and positive earnings forecasts for S&P 500 companies, suggest a bullish sentiment and corresponding conviction. Conversely, prioritize bearish sentiment if headlines reveal looming recession risks, significant market corrections, or concerning geopolitical events. Scale your conviction with the strength and consistency of this sentiment.